From 1b4f83341a4070b9da9f17fa4c9d76c8cc30eade Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Mateusz Sroka <sroka.koloron@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 22 Jul 2026 13:51:12 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] Guard non-object responses in GetTokenPriceTool before
 delete

If the token endpoint returns null or a primitive, delete parsed.description
would throw. Return the raw payload unchanged instead, which keeps the
agent flow alive and matches the existing catch behavior. Adds a test for
the null case.
---
